      "sender_id": "ruth_moran",
      "envelope": {
        "recipient": "Elsie Moran",
        "address": "17 Old Quay Lane, Solmere",
        "return": "Ruth Moran, Bellmar"
      },
      "body": "Elsie,\n\nI found the blue bowl you left in my cupboard last winter. I nearly posted it to you, then remembered what happened to the last parcel I trusted to my own packing.\n\nSo I am keeping the bowl until you visit. This letter is only to tell you not to buy another one.\n\nI also tried your lemon cake again. It still sinks in the middle. I am choosing to blame the oven.\n\nWrite when you can.\n\nRuth",
